# Drizzle (RQB v2)

## Do
- `drizzle-orm@rc` + `drizzle-kit@rc`
- Relations via `defineRelations` in `packages/db/src/relations.ts`
- Pass `relations` into `drizzle()` / `PgDrizzle.make({ relations })`
- Effect driver: `drizzle-orm/effect-postgres` + `@effect/sql-pg`
- Merge auth relations: `{ ...appRelations, ...authRelations }`

## Do not
- Per-table `relations()` (RQB v1)
- `db._query`
- Prisma

Read `.cursor/skills/drizzle-rqb2/SKILL.md` before changing schema or queries.
